"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] You think you can just beat the shit out of people to get what you want?"
},
{
"k": "7494",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You allowing torture now? Is that what we've come to?"
},
{
"k": "7495",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I saw what you did to Dee."
},
{
"k": "7496",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I saw what you did to the Woodsman!"
},
{
"k": "7497",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] What're you doing beatin' the shit out of the Woodsman, huh? He may be a good-for-nothin' drunk, but that don't mean you can just whack him around 'cause you feel like it!"
},
{
"k": "7498",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "He's a fuckin' mess! You allowing this shit to happen under your watch?"
},
{
"k": "7499",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Me?"
},
{
"k": "7500",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Poor boy saw the whole thing."
},
{
"k": "7501",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I'd love to give Tweedledee a good punch as much as the next guy, but what you did to him was way over the bloody line!"
},
{
"k": "7502",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Between you and me, I think he got what's coming to him."
},
{
"k": "7503",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "so why the hell are you acting like best mates all of a sudden?"
},
{
"k": "7504",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "you know how he roughed me up in front of my boy,"
},
{
"k": "7505",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Tell me something, you know what that man did to us,"
},
{
"k": "7506",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] Is that how you treat your prisoners?"
},
{
"k": "7507",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You're okay givin' me a slap, but Tweedledee…"
},
{
"k": "7508",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Oh, no. He deserves the royal treatment!"
},
{
"k": "7509",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Though, he ain't the only one who roughed me up in me own house."
},
{
"k": "7510",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "How do you think he feels seeing his dad beat down like that?"
},
{
"k": "7511",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Worst of it is, you did it in front of me own son."
},
{
"k": "7512",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Toad…"
},
{
"k": "7513",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Toad!"
},
{
"k": "7514",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] Don't even get started with me, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "7515",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[slight anger] Toad…"
},
{
"k": "7516",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "No harm done. I just took a little peek in the basement, is all."
},
{
"k": "7517",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] I saw what you did down there, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "7518",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "What did you expect to see?"
},
{
"k": "7519",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "It's none of your business."
},
{
"k": "7520",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-x}I'm just doing my job, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7521",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Don't put this all on me, Toad. I-"
},
{
"k": "7522",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You saw them down there…"
},
{
"k": "7523",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Bluebeard was out of line."
},
{
"k": "7524",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I wanted to do this the right way!"
},
{
"k": "7525",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{normalB}{body-standA}This is none of your business, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7526",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] {body-hips}{angryA}Your job is to protect us! That's not what you've been doing."
},
{
"k": "7527",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "If I didn't, Bluebeard would have."
},
{
"k": "7528",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{annoyedA}{body-x}[cut] This is how things are gonna go?"
},
{
"k": "7529",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{confusedA}{body-x}People get called in for \"questioning\" {angryA}{body-hips}and they get beaten to a fucking pulp?"
},
{
"k": "7530",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-x} So you've got nothing to say for yourself, then?"
},
{
"k": "7531",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "For fuck's sake, Bigby! For better or worse, I never thought you were the sort of fellow to just do what he's told. Especially when Bluebeard is involved."
},
{
"k": "7532",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "So that makes it right, then?"
},
{
"k": "7533",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You can't blame me for thinkin' the worst."
},
{
"k": "7534",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Bluebeard… He's always been a prick, hasn't he?"
},
{
"k": "7535",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-hips} No."
},
{
"k": "7536",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{ThinkingA}{body-standA}Okay, Mr. Toad."
},
{
"k": "7537",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-X}I want an explanation."
},
{
"k": "7538",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] Though I shouldn't be surprised after what you did to me."
},
{
"k": "7539",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Or did you forget?"
},
{
"k": "7540",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Real classy, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "7541",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Point taken."
},
{
"k": "7542",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "What? You think I forgot?"
},
{
"k": "7543",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I thought your job was to keep people safe!"
},
{
"k": "7544",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] I was just doing my job."
},
{
"k": "7545",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You're just goin' around beatin' on people to get what you want!"
},
{
"k": "7546",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You're supposed to make him answer for his crimes."
},
{
"k": "7547",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] That man hurt me in my own home. In front of my boy!"
},
{
"k": "7548",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{body-standA}{normalB} And what did you expect to see?"
},
{
"k": "7549",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Oh, well… good."
},
{
"k": "7550",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Glad you see it my way."
},
{
"k": "7551",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "For fuck's sake, Bigby!"
},
{
"k": "7552",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "but what you did to him was barbaric!"
},
{
"k": "7553",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Or are you both forgetting why we're here?"
},
{
"k": "7554",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "TJ…"
},
{
"k": "7555",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[muttering] Typical."
},
{
"k": "7556",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[impatient] Okay, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7557",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "He gets it."
},
{
"k": "7558",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Don't you fuckin' touch him."
},
{
"k": "7559",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I thought you were better than all this."
},
{
"k": "7560",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You were nice to my boy, acted like you was a friend of ours, but you're both the fuckin' same."
},
{
"k": "7561",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "It's not her fault."
},
{
"k": "7562",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Leave her alone!"
},
{
"k": "7563",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "It's not her fault, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7564",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "If there's anyone you should trust here, it's her."
},
{
"k": "7565",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I already told you, it was Bluebeard's fault."
},
{
"k": "7566",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Snow had nothing to do with it."
},
{
"k": "7567",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "If anyone's to blame, it's Bluebeard."
},
{
"k": "7568",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[sarcastic] Right, 'cause he's got all the power here."
},
{
"k": "7569",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "No consequences."
},
{
"k": "7570",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You think you can do whatever you want."
},
{
"k": "7571",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Blame Bluebeard."
},
{
"k": "7572",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Blame Crane."
},
{
"k": "7573",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Leave her alone, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7574",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Calm down!"
},
{
"k": "7575",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Both of you."
},
{
"k": "7576",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "It's my fault, Toad. Not her's."
},
{
"k": "7577",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "If there's anyone you can trust here, it's her."
},
{
"k": "7578",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "She didn't even know about it."
},
{
"k": "7579",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "She didn't know anything about it."
},
{
"k": "7580",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I wasn't aware of their actions in the basement."
},
{
"k": "7581",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I'm just trying to do my job, and figure out what happened to those women."
},
{
"k": "7582",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{sadB}But we would like to talk about what you found, {worriedA}if that's okay with you."
},
{
"k": "7583",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[sniffles]{fearA}{body-standscared}"
},
{
"k": "7584",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{worriedA}I know you're scared."
},
{
"k": "7585",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{happyA}It's all right."
},
{
"k": "7586",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{happyB}Are you ready to talk to Mr. Wolf?"
},
{
"k": "7587",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[sniffles]{fearA}{body-standhurt}"
},
{
"k": "7588",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "It's not optional."
},
{
"k": "7589",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I just have some questions."
},
{
"k": "7590",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You can help us."
},
{
"k": "7591",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{thinkingA}{body-x}It's not optional."
},
{
"k": "7592",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{confusedB}{body-x}I just have to {worriedA}ask you some questions."
},
{
"k": "7593",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry]{sarcasticA}{body-X} Is that{angryA} what you told The Woodsman?"
},
{
"k": "7594",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{worriedA}{body-X}It would really help us, TJ."
},
{
"k": "7595",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[angry] {angryA}{body-x}Oh, really?"
},
{
"k": "7596",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "She's right, son."
},
{
"k": "7597",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-X}You going to keep us here against our will?"
},
{
"k": "7598",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[scoffs] {happyA}{body-x}I've{body-x}{AngryA} heard that before."
},
{
"k": "7599",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "We'll leave if you want."
},
{
"k": "7600",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Well, I'm having no part of it!"
},
{
"k": "7601",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Come on, son. We're leaving!"
},
{
"k": "7602",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{angryA}{body-x}What the hell was that?"
},
{
"k": "7603",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{body-standScared}{fearA}I want{body-standA}{normalA} to help."
},
{
"k": "7604",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "He gets the point, Toad."
},
{
"k": "7605",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[threatening] {angryA}{body-pockets}Watch yourself, Bigby. {angryA}{body-x}If you do anything to hurt me boy…"
},
{
"k": "7606",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Start at the beginning."
},
{
"k": "7607",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Sorry I scared you."
},
{
"k": "7608",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You okay?"
},
{
"k": "7609",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "This won't take long."
},
{
"k": "7610",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[awkward] {confusedA}Sorry if I scared you."
},
{
"k": "7611",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[awkward] {confusedA}Are you… {confusedB}okay?"
},
{
"k": "7612",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{worriedA}Just {confusedB}start from the beginning."
},
{
"k": "7613",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{worriedA}This won't take long."
},
{
"k": "7614",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Are you friends with that bad man?"
},
{
"k": "7615",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{worriedA}{body-standscared}Why were you hurting that man?"
},
{
"k": "7616",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I was pretending."
},
{
"k": "7617",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "No, we're not friends."
},
{
"k": "7618",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I was only pretending."
},
{
"k": "7619",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "When you're the sheriff, sometimes you have to…"
},
{
"k": "7620",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "strategize."
},
{
"k": "7621",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Um…"
},
{
"k": "7622",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Are you pretending to be my friend?"
},
{
"k": "7623",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "But you were nice to him."
},
{
"k": "7624",
"who": "KIDTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "He hit my dad, right in the head. He was bleeding and everything."
},
{
"k": "7625",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I thought he hurt Snow."
},
{
"k": "7626",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I thought he had information."
},
{
"k": "7627",
